OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAnother day of sunny spells and
OL,6,Fshowers today, although showers
OL,7,Fperhaps not as widespread as Thursday.
OL,8,FSome heavy and possibly thundery
OL,9,Fshowers developing still, especially
OL,10,Fthroughout the afternoon. Feeling a
OL,11,Flittle cooler, with temperatures near
OL,12,Faverage.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FShowers will ease this
OL,15,Fevening, though some may linger into
OL,16,Fthe night towards the coast. Clearer
OL,17,Fskies will bring a rather cool night,
OL,18,Fespecially in rural areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
