OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FThe odd morning shower
OL,6,Fpossible in the east, otherwise a dry
OL,7,Fand bright day on Saturday with spells
OL,8,Fof sunshine. Temperatures near average.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:
OL,11,FRemaining dry with sunny spells on
OL,12,FSunday and Monday. Showers and
OL,13,Fpossibly thunderstorms then moving in
OL,14,Ffrom the southwest on Tuesday. Feeling
OL,15,Fwarmer, especially in the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
